{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把“只想在难受时有人陪”推成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机的解释更重，少了Y原本的留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键信息，话与感受纵向交替，且标记“到时出现”的感受跟随音乐出现，不需要观众一眼消化整串短词，扫读时更容易抓住重点。更重要的是，感受不仅具体，而且有先后、有变化，能同时听见音乐的细节、感受到人物情绪的转折，并理解他从抗拒、怀念、摇摆到最终带着想念继续生活的过程。Y虽然左右分区直观，但大量短词并列，情绪之间的关系和发展顺序不够突出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a1a9c3b1-8ff7-4280-b9ea-17dc0cc4c291", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T053511320072Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:36:48.416677+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1b489301ce70b1c068c65c36c1c0b9b567a58bbb859b3ebb18c3e5c881af401a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\